{"version":1,"key":"card:413","content":{"id":413,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"一个芯片上有两个或两个以上的 CPU 称为"},{"type":"formatted","text":"多核","color":"#6425d0","darkColor":"#a472fc"},{"type":"formatted","text":"芯片，如果 CPU 的数量继续增加时，会使用另一个名称，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"众核","color":"#6425d0","darkColor":"#a472fc"},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"多核与众核之间没有明确的区分界限，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"如果你觉得损失一两个 CPU 也无所谓","highlight":"green"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，那么就可以称之为众核了。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"info","title":"","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"GPU 是典型的众核芯片，包含成千上万的微小核，非常适合大量并行的小规模计算。"}],"disableDrag":false}]}],"tags":["概念/芯片"],"createTime":1711070511602,"updateTime":1763390420227,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1763390420227}}